wasm jit: stackalloc (OP_LOCALLOC[_IMM]) and 64-bit checked multiply (gex)

localloc takes ALIGN16(size) from __stack_pointer, zeroed under MONO_INST_INIT; a method with
one keeps an eager frame (never lazy) whose entry SP every exit restores. Refused in methods with
EH clauses, whose landing pad resets the SP to the frame base. OP_LMUL_OVF[_UN] (stackalloc
int[n] sizes, checked long math) raise OverflowException through the shared throw block with
division-based checks that cannot trap. Number.FormatFloat, BinaryReader.ReadInt32 and friends
now compile. Test: T.Localloc (Stack, MulOvf, BinaryReader round trip).

